 AI agent skill for Claude Code
 ● Installed through a shared link: Claude Code reads it from another skills folder.

 What it lets Claude Code do
   Check which account each tool uses in a folder and explain why, by running Devpit's read-only
   commands and reading its help pages. It can suggest a change and make it once you agree.

 What it never does
   ✓ Never changes anything without your yes: it asks first, every time.
   ✓ Never reads account folders, login files or tokens.

 Where it goes
   default  C:\Users\you\.claude\skills\devpit\SKILL.md                       ● installed
   work     C:\Users\you\.devpit\accounts\claude\work\skills\devpit\SKILL.md  ● shared from default

